{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2022-08-17 17:52:00', 'title': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN BOARD DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'FALLS CHURCH, VA., AUG. 17, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NYSE: NOC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.73 PER SHARE ON NORTHROP GRUMMAN COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE SEPT. 14, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS AUG. 29, 2022.'}